---
title: "Read organization SSO configuration"
icon: arrow-down-left
description: "Read organization SSO configuration: getOrganizationSsoConfiguration in the TypeScript, Python and Rust clients."
---

`GET /v1/auth/organizations/{orgId}/sso`

Returns the selected organization’s SSO connection state, configuration version, and desired and effective policy settings. Read policySyncStatus alongside the enforcement fields to distinguish requested settings from synchronized settings.

<Tabs>
<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.auth.getOrganizationSsoConfiguration(input: GetOrganizationSsoConfigurationInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<GetOrganizationSsoConfigurationOutput>
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Python">
```python Python
photon.auth.get_organization_sso_configuration(input: GetOrganizationSsoConfigurationInput) -> models.OrganizationSsoConfiguration
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Rust">
```rust Rust
client.get_organization_sso_configuration(org_id: String).await -> Result<ResponseValue<types::OrganizationSsoConfiguration>, Error<GetOrganizationSsoConfigurationError>>
```
</Tab>
</Tabs>

<RequestExample>
```typescript TypeScript
import { Photon } from "@photon-ai/api";

const photon = new Photon({
  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${process.env.PHOTON_API_TOKEN}` },
});
const result = await photon.auth.getOrganizationSsoConfiguration({
  path: {
    orgId: "orgId",
  },
});
```

```python Python
import os

from photon_api import Photon
from photon_api.rpc_generated import GetOrganizationSsoConfigurationInput

photon = Photon(headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {os.environ['PHOTON_API_TOKEN']}"})
result = photon.auth.get_organization_sso_configuration(
    GetOrganizationSsoConfigurationInput.model_validate({
        "path": {
            "orgId": "orgId",
        },
    })
)
```

```rust Rust
use photon_ai_api::{Credential, PhotonClientBuilder, SecretString};

let token = std::env::var("PHOTON_API_TOKEN")?;
let client = PhotonClientBuilder::new()
    .credential("accountServiceKey", Credential::Bearer(SecretString::from(token)))
    .build()?;
let result = client
    .get_organization_sso_configuration("orgId".to_owned())
    .await
    .map_err(|error| format!("{error:?}"))?
    .into_inner();
```

</RequestExample>

